<!--Post: 1603--><!--Time: 1102273793-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1603"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 05, 2004 - 11:09 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->In TOM&#39;s latest news update &#40;Dec. 5, &#39;04&#41; he writes: &#34;The BTK case is featured in an upcoming issue of Newsweek magazine.&#34; <BR>   Actually, he might have said &#34;TOM VOIGT &amp; his catchBTK.com site are featured!&#34;, but he was just being modest. It talks about Tom and this site throughout the article. You can read it here, <a href="http://msnbc.msn.com/id/6652288/site/newsweek" target=_top>http://msnbc.msn.com/id/6652288/site/newsweek</a> <BR>   CONGRATS, Tom! You&#39;re nationally famous- again! You&#39;ll be on every newsstand &amp; grocery store in America! Why, you are practically a household word now! Untold fame &amp; glory will surely follow. Well, maybe I got a little carried away, but you get the picture......<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1603-->
<!--Post: 1641--><!--Time: 1102486787-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1641"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 07, 2004 - 10:19 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Also, TOM: Yesterday I posted a comment about the NEWSWEEK article with a link to it, plus other BTK observations on the Crime &amp; Justice BTK site. There were several posts responding to it, but they quickly DELETED my post! Obviously, they hated the fact that your CatchBTK site was &#34;covered&#34; in NEWSWEEK &amp; not them! Naughty, naughty, naughty. Anyway, I thought it was pretty small of them.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1641-->
<!--Post: 1759--><!--Time: 1102817812-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1759"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 6:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Out of some bizarre loyalty and sense of curiosity, I picked up a copy as well. My parents will be so pleased when they show up for the holidays and see religion discussed on the cover of a magazine in my home. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1759-->
<!--Post: 1778--><!--Time: 1102836018-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1778"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 11:20 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->HILARIOUS UPDATE: I retorted to a poster and the site operator on that same Crime &amp; Justice BTK board I mentioned above. They seem to hate the fact that Tom &amp; this catchBTK site were a big focus of the new NEWSWEEK magazine BTK article. The poster actually wrote a follow-up letter to NEWSWEEK erroneously faulting them on 2 points. Both of her criticisms were proven laughably false, once you read the actual article. I also chided the site operator, &#34;RUNES1&#34;, for his very derogatory &amp; demeaning post about the article on that same thread. <BR> <BR>And guess what? That very day &#40;Thursday, I think&#41;, they DELETED THE ENTIRE &#34;NEWSWEEK&#34; THREAD!! It had about 10 or 15 posts already in only the 1st 2 days. But now, the whole thread is completely GONE! There has since been absolutely no mention of this new BTK NEWSWEEK article on that site. Very small of them, indeed.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1778-->
